### Успешный перевод
POST http://localhost:8080/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountId": 201,
  "toAccountId": 202,
  "amount": 1.00
}

### Отрицательная сумма
POST http://localhost:8080/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountId": 201,
  "toAccountId": 202,
  "amount": -10.00
}

### Несуществующий счёт
POST http://localhost:8080/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountId": 201,
  "toAccountId": 999999,
  "amount": 10.00
}

### Недостаточно средств
POST http://localhost:8080/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountId": 201,
  "toAccountId": 202,
  "amount": 999999999.00
}

### Создание клиента
POST http://localhost:8080/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Client",
  "email": "test.client@example.com"
}

### Создание счёта
POST http://localhost:8080/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": 103,
  "accountNumber": "TEST-103-001"
}